                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "10dad362-43cb-34e1-b8ef-51328f396f79",
                        "entry_id": "a7c53de7-70f1-3212-a442-d401a83400be",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein niemals am Anfang eines Wortes vorkommender Konsonantenbuchstabe zur Darstellung des stimmlosen s-Lautes"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9afb441f-024d-4a76-b26c-ca7bc51c8252",
                                "sense_id": "10dad362-43cb-34e1-b8ef-51328f396f79",
                                "text": "Das ß kommt nicht am Wortanfang vor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f25eb41f-4dac-486a-91a3-d9dfdd921aa8",
                                "sense_id": "10dad362-43cb-34e1-b8ef-51328f396f79",
                                "text": "„Es gibt einen Grund dafür, dass das ß aktuell wieder im Fokus der Gespräche steht.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2df91567-ca2e-4fc5-a5b5-27915eda7d93",
                                "sense_id": "10dad362-43cb-34e1-b8ef-51328f396f79",
                                "text": "„Im Bereich der Laut-Buchstaben-Zuordnung bleibt ß nach langem Vokal und Diphthong erhalten (Spaß, weiß), wird aber nach betontem Kurzvokal durch ss ersetzt (Kuss).“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "92d867a4-0654-43c3-9de5-163103034f5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a7c53de7-70f1-3212-a442-d401a83400be",
                        "source_sense_id": "10dad362-43cb-34e1-b8ef-51328f396f79",
                        "source_sense_description": "Konsonantenbuchstabe zur Darstellung des stimmlosen s-Lautes",
                        "target_lang_word": "ß",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ß",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75082951-bcb6-3d33-8fcd-1842dc6d4f38",
                                        "entry_id": "69185ff7-9e52-30f4-92cd-4a62c08e5e96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Occasionally used in loanwords from German."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dd82db3-9e61-4e14-b600-45b8525f85bc",
                                                "sense_id": "75082951-bcb6-3d33-8fcd-1842dc6d4f38",
                                                "text": "You're full of scheiße!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "050a76be-1865-3044-b288-54f3f07e0b83",
                                        "entry_id": "69185ff7-9e52-30f4-92cd-4a62c08e5e96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ligature representing in italic text."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31962c50-ffb7-4833-b74f-35a048e612c1",
                                                "sense_id": "050a76be-1865-3044-b288-54f3f07e0b83",
                                                "text": "As in nombers Abſtracte, euery nomber is not a rooted nomber, but ſome certaine only emongeſt theim, ſo in nombers Coßike, all nombers haue not rootes: but ſoche onely emongeſt ſimple Coßike nombers are rooted, whoſe nomber hath a roote, agreable to the figure of his denomination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ade8b3ca-5236-44cd-9ee8-f716b6f58219",
                                                "sense_id": "050a76be-1865-3044-b288-54f3f07e0b83",
                                                "text": "I am alſo aſſured by a Neighbour of mine, that a Brother of his, who is a great Cider Merchant in Devonſhire, is by frequent experience ſo well ſatisfied with the harmleſneſs of rotten Apples, that he makes no ſcruple of exchanging with any one that comes to his Cider-preß, a Buſhel of ſound-apples for the ſame meaſure of the other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39417897-6afb-45f3-9176-a69ae487a36e",
                                                "sense_id": "050a76be-1865-3044-b288-54f3f07e0b83",
                                                "text": "After my Addreß to our Great Founder and Patron, I could not but think my ſelf oblig'd, in conſideration of thoſe many Ingagements you have laid upon me, to offer theſe my poor Labours to this MOST ILLUSTRIOUS ASSEMBLY."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df3518e2-d42d-4d75-ab84-85e987903a7b",
                                                "sense_id": "050a76be-1865-3044-b288-54f3f07e0b83",
                                                "text": "And vvhat happineſs is there in a ſtorm of paſſions? On this account the Scepticks affected an indifferent æquipondious neutrality as the only means to their Ataraxia, and freedom from paßionate diſturbances."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cee9a2e1-4fa0-4c44-8a40-c49161ad24a9",
                                                "sense_id": "050a76be-1865-3044-b288-54f3f07e0b83",
                                                "text": "Paß, a VVay, Lane, River, Leave; alſo condition. VVhat a Sad Paß things are come to? In vvhat an ill State they are. That Shamm vvon't Paß, that Trick vvwon't take."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
